description	"Captain Gilad Pellaeon

Methodical Imperial Fleet Officer focusing on tactical coordination.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- E-11 Tactical Rifle (3)
-- EE-3
-- 10% more damage & 15% more FP drain
-- 10% faster velocity
-- Extended Power Cell (72 mag)
- Coordinated Strike Datapad (1)
- Stasis Grenade (3)
-- Cryo Grenade
-- Lifts targets in stasis on det
- Unstable Fuel Canister (1)
-- Pulse Grenades
-- Disintegrates, ignites, and cripples on det
- Trip Mines (3)
-- Tracks targets and knocks down on det

^5Powers:
- Stoic Resolve (Absorb 1)

^8Attributes:
- Discipline (Anti-MT 2)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (2)
- Rally
- Fleet Commander (Ally Stat Viewer)
- Fleet Tactical Scanner (Tracking Beacon)
- Tactical Illumination (Light Beacon)
- Armor Regen (1)

^3Abilities:
- Health Dispenser (2) ^3[USE In Melee]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Portable Forcefield ^3[CS2]
- Seeker Droid ^3[CS3]
- Field Medpac Supplies (2) ^3[CS4]"